[00:21.02]1. With dignity and joy,
[00:27.30]A threefold cord is bound.
[00:34.56]With God and men to witness,
[00:41.36]These sacred vows resound.
[00:44.76](Chorus 1)
[00:48.16]He vowed before Jehovah
[00:54.96]To love her from the heart.
[01:02.49]“What God has yoked together,
[01:08.49]Let no man put apart.”
[01:46.48]2. They both have searched God’s Word
[02:17.47]To learn to do his will,
[02:30.47]And now they seek his blessing,
[02:37.92]Their promise to fulfill.
[02:41.08](Chorus 2)
[02:44.24]She vowed before Jehovah
[02:51.36]To love him from the heart.
[02:58.56]“What God has yoked together,
[03:07.36]Let no man put apart.”